  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved access to Water, Sanitation and Hygiene for disadvantaged communities in the Democratic Rep</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase sustainable access to improved  water, hygiene and sanitation (WASH) facilities for 334,000 (F 174,400; M159,600) beneficiaries in rural disadvantaged communities in the DRC, Zimbabwe and Uganda. We will directly provide WASH services alongside investing in social mobilisation of communities to influence local government authorities on policy implementation, and strengthen water user groups to adopt correct use and maintenance of water points.</narrative>
  </description>
